This directory contains the real 3D images.

The following 3D images are from TU Wien University:
beetle.vtk
present.vtk
tree.vtk
Reference: https://www.cg.tuwien.ac.at/research/vis/datasets/

The following 3D images are from Stanford University:
ctheadZ.vtk
mrbrainZ.vtk
after adding a layer of voxels between any consecutive layers along
the z-direction. This has been done because z-spacing was double than
x- and y-spacing. The greylevels of the inserted layers are interpolated.
Reference: https://graphics.stanford.edu/data/voldata/

For all such images, the version avg_5_*.vtk
is the result of smooting the image by using program ../average.py 
with neighborhhod size 5x5x5.
